# See doc at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/master/prdoc/schema_user.json

title: 'Registrar: add lock and unlock'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      `pallet-registrar-para` gains `add_lock`, which shuts the manager out of a registered para,
      and `remove_lock`, for root or the para itself only.

      A para is also locked the first time it produces a head. `pallet-registrar-relay` now
      implements `paras::OnNewHead`, so add it there: `type OnNewHead = (Registrar, RegistrarRelay);`.

      `pallet-registrar-relay::authorize_code` and `cancel_authorization` are merged into a single
      `receive` at call index 0, so the transport no longer picks a call index per message variant.
      The `UnexpectedMessage` error is gone and weights split into `receive_register` and
      `receive_cancel_registration`.

crates:
  - name: registrar-primitives
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-registrar-para
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-registrar-relay
    bump: major
